WEBVTT

title
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.600
CPR Training Simulation
Third-person training simulation · Unity · guided training, practice and assessment

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.300
The app opens with a disclaimer: a training tool, not a substitute for certified hands-on training.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.150
Three modes: guided step-by-step support, independent assessment and compression practice.

3
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.550
Scenario: an adult has collapsed inside a restaurant.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:15.950
Guided mode: narration and on-screen steps lead the learner through the response.

5
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.550
Checking for a response by tapping the shoulder.

6
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:30.150
Calling the emergency number (112) on the in-game phone.

7
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:39.950 line:8%
Live rate feedback: 'Too slow' until the pace reaches 100–120 per minute.

8
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:49.800
AED: switch it on, then drag each pad onto the chest.

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.550 line:8%
A misplaced pad triggers a corrective hint.

10
00:00:53.750 --> 00:01:05.450 line:8%
Rhythm analysis, shock advised, shock delivered, compressions resume.

11
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:09.550
End of the guided run: rhythm-accuracy summary.

12
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.650
Compression Practice reports its own per-session results.

13
00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:15.650
Assessment mode: the same scenario without step-by-step guidance.

14
00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:20.650
Actions are recorded for review at the end.

15
00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:29.250
Assessment debrief: 70/100 ('Needs improvement') with domain scores and priority feedback.

